[ The canonical brainfuck hello world with nested loops, as published on
  the esolangs wiki at https://esolangs.org/wiki/Brainfuck (CC0).
  Prints "Hello World!" and a newline.
  This header sits in a loop that never runs: the initial cell is zero. ]

